Package: tagframe
Title: Embed Rendered HTML Tags in Quarto Slides as Iframes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Colin", "Rundel", , "rundel@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a knitr engine that evaluates a chunk of R code returning
    htmltools tags (for example bslib components or htmlwidgets) and embeds
    the rendered result in the knitted document as a self-contained iframe.
    This keeps Bootstrap and other component CSS isolated from the
    surrounding reveal.js or HTML document.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/rundel/tagframe
BugReports: https://github.com/rundel/tagframe/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.4.0)
Imports:
    bslib,
    htmltools,
    jsonlite,
    knitr,
    utils
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
